# mh_next_ui Core Rule

Before editing code in this repository, always follow:

1. `docs/architecture.md`
2. `docs/coding-standard.md`
3. `docs/component-pattern.md`
4. `docs/ai-rules.md`

Hard requirements:

- Prefer `@mh-repo/ui` `Mh*` components over direct raw UI usage.
- Keep menu data in one source-of-truth (header mega menu must match sidebar source).
- Make minimal, task-focused changes only.
- Validate touched scope (typecheck/build/lint as appropriate) before finishing.
- Update docs when behavior/architecture conventions change.

